use "testing" ;

"tail-call into a private word resolving a use-imported dep" test-section

\ Regression for the TCO-drops-private-word-module-deps defect. public-tail is
\ entered by a tail call ([ ... ] call), so its module-deps frame is loop-owned
\ and dropped when it tail-calls the private (call-dep). (call-dep) references
\ from-a, use-imported by the library. local-scope must capture from-a into the
\ private module's deps so it still resolves after the frame drops.
use "tco_private_deps_lib.1z" ;
[ public-tail ] call "from-a" "private word tail-called resolves module use-import" assert=
